each endpoint is commented out, along with the MSG_PARAM_SHIFT/MSG_PARAM_MASK consts
and the data/param locals it needs. Enable all of them so dmesg lists the SEP
endpoints at boot. Goal: confirm the SBIO (0x08) endpoint = Touch ID. Phase 2 prep.

